{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Earth is dead. But the deliveries never stop.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this <strong>playable demo</strong> of <i>Delivery Pals</i>, you\u2019ll step into the paws of a cat courier\u2014one of the few beings brave (or desperate) enough to deliver alien food orders on the toxic, monster-ridden ruins of Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758290/extras/1.gif?t=1749593366\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>3 uniquely hazardous maps</strong> to explore and deliver across</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>All core gameplay mechanics</strong>: use your train, collect ingredients, cook, deliver, and survive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Limited customization options</strong> for your cat courier</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full support for <strong>solo and online multiplayer</strong> (up to 7 players)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758290/extras/2.gif?t=1749593366\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You and your friends must work together aboard a highly modified delivery train. Coordinate deliveries, cook meals from ingredients scavenged in dangerous zones, and avoid alien retaliation when orders go wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the train\u2019s essential systems:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Computer Terminal</strong> to accept and manage orders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ATM</strong> to manage money and pay quotas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cameras &amp; Radar</strong> to monitor teammates and identify hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Kitchen Table &amp; Refrigerator</strong> to prepare and preserve meals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shop</strong> to grab essentials before heading out</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758290/extras/3.gif?t=1749593366\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u26a0\ufe0f The full game includes additional maps and deeper customization features. This demo gives you a strong taste of the full experience with some content limitations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is designed to be played with friends, and up to 7 players can join. It\u2019s recommended to invite at least 2 friends! However, you can also join a public game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3758290?t=1749593366","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3758290?t=1749593366","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758290/a3876ffb8738be3ddcee91a637d25679628d918d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749593366","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758290/a3876ffb8738be3ddcee91a637d25679628d918d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749593366","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Earth is dead. But the deliveries never stop.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this <strong>playable demo</strong> of <i>Delivery Pals</i>, you\u2019ll step into the paws of a cat courier\u2014one of the few beings brave (or desperate) enough to deliver alien food orders on the toxic, monster-ridden ruins of Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758290/extras/1.gif?t=1749593366\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>3 uniquely hazardous maps</strong> to explore and deliver across</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>All core gameplay mechanics</strong>: use your train, collect ingredients, cook, deliver, and survive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Limited customization options</strong> for your cat courier</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full support for <strong>solo and online multiplayer</strong> (up to 7 players)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758290/extras/2.gif?t=1749593366\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You and your friends must work together aboard a highly modified delivery train. Coordinate deliveries, cook meals from ingredients scavenged in dangerous zones, and avoid alien retaliation when orders go wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the train\u2019s essential systems:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Computer Terminal</strong> to accept and manage orders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ATM</strong> to manage money and pay quotas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cameras &amp; Radar</strong> to monitor teammates and identify hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Kitchen Table &amp; Refrigerator</strong> to prepare and preserve meals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shop</strong> to grab essentials before heading out</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758290/extras/3.gif?t=1749593366\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u26a0\ufe0f The full game includes additional maps and deeper customization features. This demo gives you a strong taste of the full experience with some content limitations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is designed to be played with friends, and up to 7 players can join. It\u2019s recommended to invite at least 2 friends! However, you can also join a public game.</p>","developers":["stre1itzia, dyrachyo"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3237570","name":"delivery pals"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758290/7d87f3ee79110dba49d38242e85b4b8f17854073/header.jpg?t=1749593366","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257152549,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152549/movie480.mp4?t=1749486241","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152549/movie_max.mp4?t=1749486241"},"name":"Steam Next Fest Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257152549/c2173253008e27687fcd547f7924588b6f19aa73/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749486241","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152549/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749486241","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152549/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749486241"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257146557,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146557/movie480.mp4?t=1749490451","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146557/movie_max.mp4?t=1749490451"},"name":"Game Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257146557/f408fdaf218b943cd9c0